{"sba-keyaki-13900":{"blocks":[{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":" \n こんばんは ✩︎⡱\n \n \n \n 個別握手会にお越し下さった皆さん\n 本当にありがとうございました!\n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHYK8QHD9VTY8YN610F73NPB","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n  \n  \n  \n 5枚目シングルの握手会も\n 早いことに昨日で終わってしまいましたね(;^;)\n \n \n 来月からは6枚目シングルの握手会が始まるし\n すぐに会えますね♪\n \n \n \n 楽しみだな〜😽💕\n \n \n \n \n \n \n いつもファンの方からお花をいただいてばかりなので、今回は私から皆さんにプレゼントです🌸🌼🌺\n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHYK8RKAA4TVX158GCBVHBYR","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n  \n  \n  \n  \n いつも素敵なお花をありがとう(●´∪`●)♡\n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHYK8SHNBE03WABRZQ4T7ACC","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n  \n  \n  \n お花、少し隠れてしまっていたり\n 分かりづらくてごめんなさい😭\n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n 今回は5枚目シングル最後の握手会ということと、バレンタインが近かったこともあり\n いつもの貼り紙に加えて少し飾り付けもしてみました🎈🎈\n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHYK8TGV1PB11FVX90F9FF99","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n  \n  \n (私も映ってしまった〜😩\n                    自己主張が激しいな!笑)\n \n \n \n お兄ちゃんセレクトのマスキングテープで\n HAPPY VALENTINE ♥︎\n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHYK8VJYRT301BSYH574FXKH","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n  \n  \n  \n 手作り感満載ですね。笑\n \n \n …器用になりたい。\n \n \n \n 皆さんにチョコを作ってみたり🎁\n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHYK8WMAJPWW6E7F1VC4JKZ3","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHYK8XNA9NYM4AT9HWC1J46B","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n  \n  \n  \n なんだか1人で握手会を楽しみすぎてて\n ごめんなさい。笑\n \n \n 喜んでいただけるかな〜って考えている時間が楽しくて、ついつい…です(   ᷇࿀ ᷆  )\n \n \n \n 6枚目シングルの握手会も\n 皆さんに楽しんでいただけたらいいなと思っているので\n \n またなんかやってるよ!!今泉😩と多めに見てあげてください😭😭\n \n \n \n \n \n \n そしてそして!!\n しんちゃんも握手会に参加しました🍑💕\n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHYK8YP4D90GMMP7CHNX4MCB","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n  \n  \n よく頑張りました👏\n \n \n 隣にちょこんと座って\n 皆さんのことをお出迎えしていました♪\n \n \n \n またしんちゃんも遊びに連れていくね〜!\n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHYK8ZNR4JGNXGQZM9EPBA0D","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n  \n  \n  \n またね ◡̈⃝︎⋆︎*"}],"source":"archive"},"sba-keyaki-7132":{"blocks":[{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんばんなーこ(*⌒▽⌒*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"たまご観察日記2日目。変化なし。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"このー。"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHN2723W3YXVSRNNEKM6BH87","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHN273F7MX31QW0BNC9T4CAR","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"出てこいや。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日はねー!(木下ゆうかさん風)\nなーこクッキング⑤です。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"作るのは、うどんです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"うー   Don!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"とても簡単そうだったので、作ってみました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"〜用意するもの〜\n薄力粉打ち粉塩麺つゆ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"〜作り方〜\n薄力粉と塩水をかき混ぜます。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それをまとめて、ロール状にし、3つ折りにします。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"角を集めて、こね玉にします。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こね玉。"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHN274RZ813DN6E65SS2NPBD","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"雪見だいふくみたい!\n雪見だいふくだったらいいのに。\n中にあんこと苺入ってたら最高。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これを袋に入れて、5〜10分寝かします。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おやすみなさい。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"このあと、生地を伸ばします。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"起きろーーー!!っ `-´ c)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"伸ばす厚さは3ミリくらい。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして、、、、 (。-`ω´-))つ=lニニフｻﾞｸ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHN276H1W0XGKC27N4A9ZJN5","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"麺になりました!!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"切るの、時間かかりました｡°(っ°´o`°c) °｡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"うまく切れたかな。切れたよね?\nね?|´-`)ﾁﾗｯ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これを沸騰したお湯で茹でます。"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHN27858QKY3VQ391M2J8V64","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いっきにツヤツヤになりした｡・:+°"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もう食べたい。\nでも、我慢。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"麺つゆにいれて･･･"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHN279EYAPX92T1WJ9RKX3QP","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんな感じになりました!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"シンプルにそのまんまで食べました。\n粉の味がしました。\n手作りぽい味(,,･ω･,,)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"うどん作りも楽しかったなあ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今度は、前から大好きな、チーズを作ってみようと思います。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お楽しみに〜。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おべんとう 冬  と。"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHN27AZCBXHD0QP17F7FHAMY","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"